293
00:10:55,477 --> 00:10:57,915
Why does a Bugatti need such a

294
00:10:57,915 --> 00:10:59,215
special gearbox?

295
00:10:59,395 --> 00:11:02,788
Because no normal gearbox could handle the

296
00:11:02,788 --> 00:11:03,273
force.

297
00:11:03,453 --> 00:11:06,968
The W sixteen produces a huge twisting

298
00:11:06,968 --> 00:11:08,911
