299
00:11:08,911 --> 00:11:12,334
well over one thousand newton metres.

300
00:11:12,514 --> 00:11:15,138
A normal car gearbox would break.

301
00:11:15,318 --> 00:11:17,916
The Veyron uses a seven speed dual

302
00:11:17,916 --> 00:11:22,043
clutch gearbox, developed with the British engineering

303
00:11:22,043 --> 00:11:25,558
company Ricardo, built to survive that torque.

304
00:11:25,909 --> 00:11:28,351
It changes gear in a fraction of

305
00:11:28,351 --> 00:11:31,480
a second, without interrupting the power,

306
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:34,075
using the same dual clutch idea as

307
00:11:34,075 --> 00:11:35,220
