310
00:11:39,717 --> 00:11:42,324
because no two tyres could put a

311
00:11:42,324 --> 00:11:45,094
thousand horsepower onto the road.

312
00:11:45,274 --> 00:11:47,548
Four wheel drive is the only way

313
00:11:47,548 --> 00:11:49,964
the Bugatti can use its power from

314
00:11:49,964 --> 00:11:51,172
