315
00:11:51,522 --> 00:11:52,618
And of course,

316
00:11:52,618 --> 00:11:54,575
the gearbox gets hot too.

317
00:11:54,755 --> 00:11:56,803
It has its own oil cooler,

318
00:11:56,803 --> 00:11:59,480
and so does the rear differential.

319
00:11:59,660 --> 00:12:01,750
If you count the radiators again,

320
00:12:01,750 --> 00:12:03,903
you will find them for the gearbox

321
00:12:03,903 --> 00:12:05,233
