332
00:12:29,705 --> 00:12:32,378
straights of any test track in the

333
00:12:32,378 --> 00:12:34,737
world, and it is closed to the

334
00:12:34,737 --> 00:12:35,287
public.

335
00:12:35,637 --> 00:12:36,720
In twenty ten,

336
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:39,739
the Veyron Super Sport set a production

337
00:12:39,739 --> 00:12:42,370
car record there of more than four

338
00:12:42,370 --> 00:12:45,389
