339
00:12:45,569 --> 00:12:47,112
In twenty nineteen,

340
00:12:47,112 --> 00:12:48,574
a modified Chiron,

341
00:12:48,574 --> 00:12:50,442
driven by Andy Wallace,

342
00:12:50,442 --> 00:12:53,203
