352
00:13:13,893 --> 00:13:15,436
The ten radiators,

353
00:13:15,436 --> 00:13:16,635
the W sixteen,

354
00:13:16,635 --> 00:13:19,891
the airbrake and the special tyres all

355
00:13:19,891 --> 00:13:21,776
meet on that straight.

356
00:13:21,956 --> 00:13:24,011
It is the one place where the

357
00:13:24,011 --> 00:13:26,775
