358
00:13:27,125 --> 00:13:28,564
So here are the ten.

359
00:13:28,744 --> 00:13:31,925
Ten radiators for ten kinds of heat.

360
00:13:32,105 --> 00:13:35,429
A W sixteen engine to fit sixteen

361
00:13:35,429 --> 00:13:36,436
